00:31:11,000 --> 00:31:13,500
[MUSIC TURNS TENSE]

735
00:31:13,500 --> 00:31:14,833
Hurry!

736
00:31:15,800 --> 00:31:17,000
Hey, what is it?

737
00:31:17,267 --> 00:31:19,100
- What's happening?
- Why are you running?

738
00:31:19,867 --> 00:31:21,300
What's happening?

739
00:31:23,800 --> 00:31:25,133
Why? What's happening?

740
00:31:26,533 --> 00:31:28,300
Juvelyn! Juvelyn!

741
00:31:29,167 --> 00:31:30,767
What's happening?
What's happening?!

742
00:31:30,767 --> 00:31:32,667
The owner
of Ginintuang Lupa is here!

743
00:31:32,667 --> 00:31:33,833
- It's...
- Who?

744
00:31:33,833 --> 00:31:35,333
Ricardo Jacinto!

745
00:31:35,333 --> 00:31:36,967
He wants to demolish our homes!

746
00:31:36,967 --> 00:31:38,067
[ALL] What?!

747
00:31:38,667 --> 00:31:40,000
He can't do that!
This is our home!

748
00:31:40,267 --> 00:31:42,300
- We own this land!
- This land is ours!

749
00:31:42,300 --> 00:31:44,200
Dante, come with me!
Let's go there!

750
00:31:44,233 --> 00:31:45,700
What will happen to us?

751
00:31:46,800 --> 00:31:47,833
Call Betchay!

752
00:31:48,367 --> 00:31:49,700
Betchay! Mameng!

753
00:31:50,367 --> 00:31:52,167
- Hurry!
- Rudy asked you to come.

754
00:31:52,167 --> 00:31:53,300
Where?

755
00:31:53,300 --> 00:31:55,200
I don't know. I'll go there
to see what's happening.

756
00:31:55,200 --> 00:31:57,133
- Why? What's happen--
- Hey, what's this about?

757
00:31:57,133 --> 00:31:58,700
I heard Rudy's name.
What's happening?

758
00:31:58,700 --> 00:32:01,033
I'm not sure.
Why are they running? Hey!

759
00:32:01,800 --> 00:32:04,367
We're not going anywhere.

760
00:32:04,733 --> 00:32:06,367
Period! Go away!

761
00:32:06,367 --> 00:32:08,800
[CROWD CHEERING]

762
00:32:08,800 --> 00:32:11,500
This land is ours!
Am I right, neighbors?

763
00:32:11,500 --> 00:32:14,000
[CROWD CHEERS] Yes!

764
00:32:14,000 --> 00:32:17,500
Oh, please! Please!

765
00:32:17,533 --> 00:32:19,400
Know your place!

766
00:32:19,400 --> 00:32:21,500
Learn to know your place.

767
00:32:21,500 --> 00:32:24,067
[CROWD CLAMORING]

768
00:32:24,067 --> 00:32:25,700
Get out! Get out of here!

769
00:32:27,867 --> 00:32:28,867
Get out!

770
00:32:29,067 --> 00:32:31,500
No way! You can't pass!
Get out of here!

771
00:32:34,033 --> 00:32:37,000
Again, we own this land!

772
00:32:37,000 --> 00:32:41,800
[TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES]

773
00:32:44,167 --> 00:32:46,700
- You should leave instead!
- You can't live here for free!

774
00:32:47,867 --> 00:32:50,500
[RICARDO] We're just taking back
our property!

775
00:32:50,533 --> 00:32:52,033
All of you should be thankful

776
00:32:52,033 --> 00:32:54,033
that we're giving you time

777
00:32:54,033 --> 00:32:55,900
to look for a new place!

778
00:32:55,900 --> 00:32:57,200
Ricardo!

779
00:32:57,633 --> 00:33:01,533
- [BLOW LANDS]
- [PEOPLE CLAMORING]

780
00:33:01,533 --> 00:33:02,900
You bastard!

781
00:33:02,900 --> 00:33:04,733
You're still following me
until here?!

782
00:33:04,733 --> 00:33:11,700
[TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

783
00:33:12,433 --> 00:33:13,500
Rudy?

784
00:33:17,433 --> 00:33:19,000
Would you look at that.

785
00:33:21,300 --> 00:33:22,567
To this day

786
00:33:23,267 --> 00:33:24,700
you're still a good for nothing.

787
00:33:26,167 --> 00:33:28,733
You'll pay for what you did
to my family!

788
00:33:28,733 --> 00:33:33,400
- [BLOWS LANDING]
- [BOTH GRUNTING]

789
00:33:33,400 --> 00:33:34,567
[THUDS]

790
00:33:34,567 --> 00:33:36,567
[PEOPLE CLAMORING]

791
00:33:36,567 --> 00:33:42,533
- [SMACKING]
- [BLOWS LANDING]

792
00:33:42,767 --> 00:33:44,500
Mameng! Betchay!

793
00:33:44,500 --> 00:33:46,900
- Hey, sis!
- What on earth?

794
00:33:46,900 --> 00:33:48,467
- Mameng! Betchay!
- Goodness me.

795
00:33:48,467 --> 00:33:51,067
- Rudy is in a brawl!
- Huh?!

796
00:33:51,067 --> 00:33:52,767
He punched the land lord!

797
00:33:52,767 --> 00:33:54,667
Oh, let's go to him quickly!

798
00:33:54,667 --> 00:33:56,400
Elton, let's go!

799
00:33:56,433 --> 00:34:00,933
- [TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES]
- [PEOPLE CLAMORING]

800
00:34:00,933 --> 00:34:01,967
[BLOW LANDS]

801
00:34:04,300 --> 00:34:06,433
- [BAG SMACKS]
- Excuse me! Where's Rudy?

802
00:34:06,433 --> 00:34:07,500
- [BAG SMACKS]
- [BLOW LANDS]

803
00:34:07,500 --> 00:34:08,533
Hey!

804
00:34:08,533 --> 00:34:12,467
- [BAG SMACKING]
- [BETCHAY GRUNTING]

805
00:34:13,600 --> 00:34:15,467
- [BLOW LANDS]
- [RICARDO SCREAMS]

806
00:34:17,933 --> 00:34:20,400
[MAMENG] Rudy! Rudy!

807
00:34:21,133 --> 00:34:23,333
- [BLOWS LANDING]
- [RICARDO SCREAMS]

808
00:34:23,333 --> 00:34:30,267
- [PEOPLE CLAMORING]
- [ISOBEL] Ricardo!

809
00:34:32,500 --> 00:34:34,333
[BLOWS LANDING]

810
00:34:34,333 --> 00:34:37,533
Rudy, that's enough!
Rudy, come on!

811
00:34:37,533 --> 00:34:38,833
You bastard!

812
00:34:38,833 --> 00:34:40,933
- Rudy!
- Serves you right!

813
00:34:41,167 --> 00:34:43,300
- Go ahead! Get him!
- That's enough!

814
00:34:43,300 --> 00:34:44,933
- Hey!
- Stop it!

815
00:34:47,367 --> 00:34:48,633
Let go of me!

816
00:34:49,400 --> 00:34:50,967
Get out of here! Leave!

817
00:34:53,300 --> 00:34:55,367
- Serves you right!
- Hey!

818
00:34:56,067 --> 00:34:57,767
Mark my words...

819
00:34:58,133 --> 00:35:00,500
I'll make sure that someday

820
00:35:00,500 --> 00:35:02,567
I'll drive all of you
out of here!

821
00:35:02,600 --> 00:35:05,833
[PEOPLE CLAMORING]

822
00:35:05,833 --> 00:35:07,367
I'll be back.

823
00:35:09,533 --> 00:35:11,000
We'll be back!

824
00:35:11,000 --> 00:35:14,333
- [PEOPLE CLAMORING]
- [THUDDING]

825
00:35:14,333 --> 00:35:15,500
[MAN] Get out of here!

826
00:35:15,500 --> 00:35:16,700
Leave!

827
00:35:16,700 --> 00:35:23,700
[PEOPLE CLAMORING]

828
00:35:23,700 --> 00:35:28,533
[TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES]

829
00:35:28,533 --> 00:35:29,700
(Speaking in Japanese)

830
00:35:29,700 --> 00:35:31,300
I'm sorry, Mr. Nishikawa!

831
00:35:31,600 --> 00:35:33,533
- Boss...
- I'll leave him to your care.

832
00:35:33,533 --> 00:35:36,233
- [MAN, INAUDIBLE]
- Ricardo, what should we do?!

833
00:35:36,267 --> 00:35:38,267
We should report this
to the police!

834
00:35:38,267 --> 00:35:39,533
- Go do it.
- Okay!

835
00:35:39,533 --> 00:35:42,233
Your days are numbered
here in Ginintuang Lupa!

836
00:35:43,033 --> 00:35:45,833
It's mine! I own this land!

837
00:35:46,100 --> 00:35:47,867
- It's mine!
- Sir, let's leave!

838
00:35:47,867 --> 00:35:54,867
- [PEOPLE CLAMORING]
- [OBJECTS THUDDING]

839
00:36:02,033 --> 00:36:03,567
You know, it's better if you put

840
00:36:03,567 --> 00:36:04,967
<i>the clearing operations
on hold for now.</i>

841
00:36:04,967 --> 00:36:06,367
<i> I know what I'm doing</i>

842
00:36:06,367 --> 00:36:08,433
<i>and what I should do
with my property!</i>

843
00:36:08,433 --> 00:36:10,033
- [POLICE SIREN WAILING]
- [OBJECTS THUDDING]

844
00:36:10,067 --> 00:36:12,567
[PEOPLE CLAMORING]

845
00:36:12,567 --> 00:36:14,567
<i>You can never us make us
leave this place!</i>

846
00:36:15,400 --> 00:36:17,467
<i> It's not easy
to take over Ginintuang Lupa.</i>

847
00:36:17,467 --> 00:36:19,400
The people there are ferocious.

848
00:36:19,400 --> 00:36:21,067
<i>You'll never tear
our houses down!</i>

849
00:36:21,067 --> 00:36:22,267
[THUDS]

850
00:36:22,267 --> 00:36:26,967
- [PEOPLE CLAMORING]
- [THUDDING]

851
00:36:26,967 --> 00:36:28,200
[KICK LANDS]

852
00:36:29,500 --> 00:36:31,967
Let us all fight for our rights!

853
00:36:31,967 --> 00:36:33,467
<i>Sir, it's too dangerous.
Let's leave!</i>

854
00:36:33,467 --> 00:36:35,567
- [HITS LANDING]
<i> - It's Gabo!</i>

855
00:36:38,067 --> 00:36:40,233
- [HITS LANDING]
<i> - I finally caught you!</i>

856
00:36:40,733 --> 00:36:42,900
- [BLOWS LANDING]
<i> - Move out of the way!</i>

857
00:36:42,933 --> 00:36:44,300
[GUNSHOT]
